                                                      Instructions for Snake.     Snake is a simple game but can get quite addictive.It involves     steering a snake around the screen eating dots.If you hit anything      other than a dot the game is over.If you eat a dot the snake gets     longer! Eat all the dots and you move up a level.New levels mean     more dots and obstacles.See how long you can last!                                                                                               Controls.     Controlling the snake only involves two keys.Cursor left for left,     and cursor right for right.Note though that left and right is from     the snakes point of view. A little practise and it becomes second     nature! I could have used all the cursor keys for each direction     but found using two easier going.                                Installing.     Simply load Snake.opa into the \APP\ directory and Snake.pic into     the \OPD\ directory.When you`ve done this go to system screen and     select Install application from the menus.Install Snake.opa using     this menu and you should get the Snake icon on the system screen.     Select this to run the game.                                  Notes.     The program took me about two weeks to write and I think it plays     quite well.My personal high score is 496. Let me know if you like     the game and also if you know of other bbs`s with Psion stuff.     Messages cane be left for me on Mission Impossible.Snake can be     freely distributed but must always have this doc file with it.                      Nick.